Tsunami
=======

MUI-based Amiga frontend for NetSurf (AmigaOS 3 / vbcc).

Build:

  make -f VMakefile Tsunami

Links like NetSurf: static hubbub.lib and dom.lib (not hubbub.library /
dom.library).

Requires muimaster.library (MUI 3.8 or MUI 5.0). Textinput.mcc is
optional for the URL bar (falls back to MUIC_String).

Source directory: frontends/mui
